{"title": "Key (The Waning Moon)", "pageid": 55917, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Key_(The_Waning_Moon)", "categories": ["Misc items", "Story items", "Keys"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-story\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Key_Iron_A.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Key_Iron_A.png/300px-Key_Iron_A.png.webp, /w/images/4/44/Key_Iron_A.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Key (The Waning Moon) image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Key_Iron_A.png/300px-Key_Iron_A.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/Key_Iron_A.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Key (The Waning Moon)</span></a> is a miscellaneous <a href=\"/wiki/Story_Item\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Story Item\">Story Item</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A small iron key.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Story Item\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Story Item</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.01 kg (0.02 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.01 kg (0.02 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Lying on a towel near the outhouse at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-210&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-49</span> in <a href=\"/wiki/Reithwin_Town\" title=\"Reithwin Town\">Reithwin Town</a></li>\n<li>Lying on a broken cupboard inside the <a href=\"/wiki/Waning_Moon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Waning Moon\">Waning Moon</a> attic at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-190&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-87</span> in <a href=\"/wiki/Reithwin_Town\" title=\"Reithwin Town\">Reithwin Town</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Opens the door to the Waning Moon attic at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-187&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-53</span>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>There are two copies of this key, which allows to open the door when approaching it from either side.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202938\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1052/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11134/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3041/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 691334/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   27.694      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   27.694      1 -total\n 26.83%    7.430      4 Template:Icon_text\n 22.55%    6.246      1 Template:Main_only\n 21.28%    5.893      1 Template:PageSeo\n 21.04%    5.827      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 20.27%    5.613     10 Template:Trim\n 12.70%    3.517      1 Template:Icon_link\n  9.93%    2.751      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  9.76%    2.703      4 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:55917-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202938 and revision id 360449. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}